# PostgreSQL schema fragment.
# @requires eks-platform
#
# POSTGRESQL_REPLICA_COUNT, POSTGRESQL_STORAGE_CLASS, POSTGRESQL_IMAGE_REPO,
# POSTGRESQL_OPERATOR_VERSION, POSTGRESQL_BACKUP_ENABLED, and
# POSTGRESQL_BACKUP_SCHEDULE were removed 2026-07-31 (Issue #4): declared here
# since Phase 3 planning but never consumed by any script, Terraform module,
# or Kubernetes manifest (verified via repo-wide search, including
# scripts/lib/packages/40-postgresql/). Dev/SIT run CNPG in-cluster (real
# config lives in the CNPG Cluster manifest, not here); UAT/Prod run AWS
# Aurora RDS via Terraform (platform-prerequisites/terraform/postgresql) --
# see docs/references/postgresql-platform-contract.md and
# docs/references/component-catalog.md for the current Dev/SIT-vs-UAT/Prod
# split.
